Package: isCORAL
Type: Package
Title: in-silico clone reconstruction in the landscape
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Yongjie Lin <linyjie@pku.edu.cn>
Maintainer: Yongjie Lin <linyjie@pku.edu.cn>
Description: A scalable pipeline for identifying genes whose expression patterns define an underlying structure or state within a single-cell population. Beta 1.0.0 uses raw counts by default, supports Seurat v4 and v5 assay access, provides transcriptome-only pseudoclone inference, deterministic pseudoclone assignment, selected-gene clonal-expression visualization, experimental lineage-barcode memory-score comparison, and embedding-based Metaclone analysis, retains compatibility with historical Metaclone entry points, and stores resolved embedding parameters and provenance.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Unix-like operating system for the fork-based doMC core scan backend
